{"content_hash": "11a920d41a67ddf1", "version_id": 714, "article_id": 72, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Kylie Jenner wears $50m bra at Victoria's Secret show", "title_zh": "凯莉·詹娜穿5000万美元胸衣亮相维密秀，引发争议", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "bbc_culture", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmx2wqwxvyxlo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/flagged/photo-1557286249-08f5bc2ef21d?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8a3lsaWUlMjBqZW5uZXJ8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5MjQ1NjMzNXww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Joel Muniz on Unsplash", "author": "Joel Muniz", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@jmuniz?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/man-pointing-forward-mXF1hOJ37BI?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(338, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(16, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "8b222ce941c5"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-20", "word_count": 214, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "Reality TV star Kylie Jenner made her Victoria's Secret Fashion Show debut on Sunday wearing a $50m Fantasy Bra. The choice pleased some fans but upset others, who felt a veteran model should have worn it.", "lead_zh": "真人秀明星凯莉·詹娜周日首次登上维多利亚的秘密时装秀，身穿价值5000万美元的“梦幻胸衣”。这一选择让一些粉丝高兴，却让另一些人不满，他们认为这件胸衣应该由资深模特来穿。", "preview": "The make-up mogul surprised the crowd at the lingerie brand's annual show by wearing the famous Fantasy Bra. According to the designer, it w", "preview_zh": "这位美妆大亨身穿著名的“梦幻胸衣”亮相该内衣品牌的年度大秀，令观众惊喜。据设计师介绍，这件胸衣由18K金和4410颗钻石制成。多年来，穿上这件胸衣一直被视为一种荣誉，也是被选中模特的标志性时刻。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 702, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/72/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 79.575, "size_bytes": 478368, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 235, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/72/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 80.575, "size_bytes": 484416, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 235, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/72/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/72/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 86.05, "size_bytes": 517248, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 235, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/72/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/72/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 74.6, "size_bytes": 448560, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 235, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/72/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/72/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 79.825, "size_bytes": 479952, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 235, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/72/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@5e0dbb9/content/data/versions/714.json", "paragraphs": ["The make-up mogul surprised the crowd at the lingerie brand's annual show by wearing the famous Fantasy Bra. According to the designer, it was made of 18-carat gold and 4,410 diamonds. Wearing this piece has long been seen as an honour and a defining moment for the chosen model.", "Some fans were delighted that the 29-year-old Kardashians star was picked, while many others criticised the brand for not giving the chance to a veteran supermodel. One commenter said the show had gone from iconic glamour to an influencer circus, and that social media fame had replaced real modelling talent.", "Marketing expert Joel Marlinarson said the moment was well engineered and generated a lot of conversation. He explained that brands now prioritise who will attract the most attention rather than who fits the traditional definition of a model. However, he added that older viewers may see it as a betrayal of the Naomi Campbell era.", "Victoria's Secret's chief creative officer, Adam Selman, told Vogue that Jenner was chosen because she is a cultural powerhouse who extends beyond fashion and television. British model Summer Nesbeth said the brand was trying to keep up with young fans, but she also questioned the focus on such an expensive bra when many people are struggling to afford basic needs."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这位美妆大亨身穿著名的“梦幻胸衣”亮相该内衣品牌的年度大秀，令观众惊喜。据设计师介绍，这件胸衣由18K金和4410颗钻石制成。多年来，穿上这件胸衣一直被视为一种荣誉，也是被选中模特的标志性时刻。", "一些粉丝为这位29岁的卡戴珊家族明星被选中而高兴，但许多人批评品牌没有把机会给资深超模。一位评论者说，这场秀已经从经典的魅力变成了网红的马戏团，社交媒体名气取代了真正的模特才华。", "营销专家乔尔·马利纳森表示，这一时刻经过精心设计，引发了大量讨论。他解释说，品牌现在优先考虑谁能吸引最多关注，而不是谁符合传统模特的定义。不过，他补充说，年长观众可能会认为这是对娜奥米·坎贝尔时代的背叛。", "维多利亚的秘密首席创意官亚当·塞尔曼告诉《Vogue》，选择詹娜是因为她是一位文化强者，影响力超越时尚和电视。英国模特萨默·内斯贝斯表示，品牌是在努力跟上年轻粉丝，但她也质疑，在许多人连基本生活都难以负担时，为何要把焦点放在如此昂贵的胸衣上。"], "body": "The make-up mogul surprised the crowd at the lingerie brand's annual show by wearing the famous Fantasy Bra. According to the designer, it was made of 18-carat gold and 4,410 diamonds. Wearing this piece has long been seen as an honour and a defining moment for the chosen model.\n\nSome fans were delighted that the 29-year-old Kardashians star was picked, while many others criticised the brand for not giving the chance to a veteran supermodel. One commenter said the show had gone from iconic glamour to an influencer circus, and that social media fame had replaced real modelling talent.\n\nMarketing expert Joel Marlinarson said the moment was well engineered and generated a lot of conversation. He explained that brands now prioritise who will attract the most attention rather than who fits the traditional definition of a model. However, he added that older viewers may see it as a betrayal of the Naomi Campbell era.\n\nVictoria's Secret's chief creative officer, Adam Selman, told Vogue that Jenner was chosen because she is a cultural powerhouse who extends beyond fashion and television. British model Summer Nesbeth said the brand was trying to keep up with young fans, but she also questioned the focus on such an expensive bra when many people are struggling to afford basic needs.", "body_zh": "这位美妆大亨身穿著名的“梦幻胸衣”亮相该内衣品牌的年度大秀，令观众惊喜。据设计师介绍，这件胸衣由18K金和4410颗钻石制成。多年来，穿上这件胸衣一直被视为一种荣誉，也是被选中模特的标志性时刻。\n\n一些粉丝为这位29岁的卡戴珊家族明星被选中而高兴，但许多人批评品牌没有把机会给资深超模。一位评论者说，这场秀已经从经典的魅力变成了网红的马戏团，社交媒体名气取代了真正的模特才华。\n\n营销专家乔尔·马利纳森表示，这一时刻经过精心设计，引发了大量讨论。他解释说，品牌现在优先考虑谁能吸引最多关注，而不是谁符合传统模特的定义。不过，他补充说，年长观众可能会认为这是对娜奥米·坎贝尔时代的背叛。\n\n维多利亚的秘密首席创意官亚当·塞尔曼告诉《Vogue》，选择詹娜是因为她是一位文化强者，影响力超越时尚和电视。英国模特萨默·内斯贝斯表示，品牌是在努力跟上年轻粉丝，但她也质疑，在许多人连基本生活都难以负担时，为何要把焦点放在如此昂贵的胸衣上。", "text": "The make-up mogul surprised the crowd at the lingerie brand's annual show by wearing the famous Fantasy Bra. According to the designer, it was made of 18-carat gold and 4,410 diamonds. Wearing this piece has long been seen as an honour and a defining moment for the chosen model. Some fans were delighted that the 29-year-old Kardashians star was picked, while many others criticised the brand for not giving the chance to a veteran supermodel. One commenter said the show had gone from iconic glamour to an influencer circus, and that social media fame had replaced real modelling talent. Marketing expert Joel Marlinarson said the moment was well engineered and generated a lot of conversation. He explained that brands now prioritise who will attract the most attention rather than who fits the traditional definition of a model. However, he added that older viewers may see it as a betrayal of the Naomi Campbell era. Victoria's Secret's chief creative officer, Adam Selman, told Vogue that Jenner was chosen because she is a cultural powerhouse who extends beyond fashion and television. British model Summer Nesbeth said the brand was trying to keep up with young fans, but she also questioned the focus on such an expensive bra when many people are struggling to afford basic needs.", "vocab": [{"word": "debut", "pos": "noun", "zh": "首次亮相", "note": "常与 make 搭配：make one's debut", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "spark", "pos": "verb", "zh": "引发", "note": "spark reaction/debate，新闻常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "mixed reaction", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "褒贬不一的反应", "note": "表示有人支持有人反对", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "mogul", "pos": "noun", "zh": "大亨", "note": "指某行业有权势的人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "criticise", "pos": "verb", "zh": "批评", "note": "英式拼写，美式为 criticize", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "veteran", "pos": "adj", "zh": "资深的", "note": "veteran model 资深模特", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "generate", "pos": "verb", "zh": "产生，引发", "note": "generate conversation/attention", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "prioritise", "pos": "verb", "zh": "优先考虑", "note": "英式拼写，美式为 prioritize", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "betrayal", "pos": "noun", "zh": "背叛", "note": "语气较强，指辜负信任", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "powerhouse", "pos": "noun", "zh": "强者，实力派", "note": "cultural powerhouse 文化影响力强的人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "keep up with", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "跟上", "note": "keep up with young fans 跟上年轻粉丝", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "afford", "pos": "verb", "zh": "负担得起", "note": "常与 can/can't 连用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-20T00:32:12.999882", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.325, "sm": 250, "em": 325, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "make-up", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.725, "sm": 325, "em": 724, "cs": 4, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "mogul", "s": 0.725, "e": 1.137, "sm": 725, "em": 1137, "cs": 12, "ce": 17, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "surprised", "s": 1.137, "e": 1.612, "sm": 1137, "em": 1612, "cs":